If you want to get started right away, feel free to skip this introduction and head straight to [[Installation]].

!! Abstract:

> ''Create flashcards in TiddlyWiki, in a state of flow. Review with Anki.''

TiddlyFlashcards is more than just a plugin. It's a workflow that connects TiddlyWiki with Anki, making it easier to turn understanding into long-term memory.

* ''TiddlyWiki'' is where you explore, understand, and organize knowledge.
* ''TiddlyFlashcards'' is where you focus on extracting and creating flashcards.
* ''Anki'' is where you review and reinforce what you've learned.

The idea is simple: separate knowledge writing from flashcard creation, but keep them connected.

